WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.870
SPEAKER 1: OK, our first speaker
this morning is Abigail Shrier.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:06.630
She's a graduate
of Columbia College

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:09.090
and went on to earn a
Bachelor of Philosophy degree

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:14.220
from the University of Oxford
and a JD from Yale Law School.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.130
She's a frequent contributor
to The Wall Street Journal.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.770
And she's the author
of Irreversible Damage,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:24.210
The Transgender Craze
Seducing Our Daughters.

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.150
It was named a best
book by The Economist

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.860
and The Times of London.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.070
And she'll be drawing on themes
from that book in her talk

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.390
today.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:37.560
In a recent essay on Substack,
she wrote about Big Tech

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.950
censorship of arguments that
question this transgender

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:41.910
craze.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:45.000
In this particular
case, her subject

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.020
was amazon.com's sudden
removal from its website

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.560
of a book that is critical of
the contemporary transgender

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.570
movement.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.350
She argued that this
kind of censorship

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:59.460
has the effect of suppressing
free speech both now

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.590
and in the future.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:04.200
As she wrote in her
essay, and I'm quoting,

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.980
"This is the chilling effect
of censorship that John Milton

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.640
called 'the greatest displeasure
and indignity to a free

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:16.290
and knowing spirit that can be
put upon him.'" She continued,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.900
"When censorship is
imposed by the government

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:23.190
or the world's third
largest multinational,

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:26.970
it forbids new
life like a frost."

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:30.060
Well, we at Hillsdale happen to
think the right to free speech

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:30.970
is essential.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.960
And so to our speaker I
say, welcome to the spring

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.881
thaw, Abigail Shrier.

00:01:35.881 --> 00:01:46.463
[APPLAUSE]

00:01:46.463 --> 00:01:47.760
ABIGAIL SHRIER: Thank you.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.940
I have to adjust this.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:51.510
Thank you so much for that
very kind introduction.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:53.820
And thank you so much to
Hillsdale for having me

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.470
here today.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.400
So social conservatives
are increasingly

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:04.440
asked to justify why they have
decided to target transgender

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:08.520
youth as if they picked this
issue because it polls well

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.370
or some other such nonsense.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:15.630
Let me make it clear why this
has suddenly become my concern.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:21.900
It is because in America in
2007 had exactly one gender

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.330
clinic, one.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:28.035
Anyone care to guess
how many we have now?

00:02:28.035 --> 00:02:29.520
AUDIENCE: Thousands.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.550
ABIGAIL SHRIER: 300.

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:36.330
So there are now hundreds
of pediatric gender clinics

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.980
in the US.

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:42.540
Planned Parenthood gives out
testosterone on a first visit.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.700
Depending on the
state, it absolutely

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.370
gives testosterone to minors.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:49.320
Planned Parenthood
in Oregon gives it

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:52.740
to 15-year-old girls on
their own recognizance.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:55.860
They don't even need
a parental note.

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.790
Kaiser dispenses it.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.090
So for today's
teens, whether they

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.690
have real or typical
gender dysphoria or not,

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:06.420
testosterone is
easily available.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:11.100
Double mastectomy, known as top
surgery, is readily available.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:14.500
No, they do not necessarily
need parental approval

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.600
depending on the state.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:20.040
And they definitely don't
need a therapist note.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:23.100
OK, so let's talk about
the transgender phenomenon.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.340
I'm going to start by walking
through the major issues

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:30.330
and claims about youth and
adolescent gender transition.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.500
And we'll work our way
to the big question,

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.470
which is, how did we get here?

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.680
How did we get to a
place in which we're all

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.200
supposed to pretend
that the only way you

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:44.910
know that I'm a woman is
if I give you my pronouns?

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:48.780
How did we get to an America in
which a 15-year-old in Oregon

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.090
can begin a course
of testosterone

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:54.000
without her parents' permission?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.190
A lot of the answer, of course,
comes from the hard left.

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.220
But at least one
part of the answer

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.880
is conservative squeamishness
about issues we'd rather not

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.420
deal with at all.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:07.810
So let's begin by
dealing with it.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.320
What is gender dysphoria?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.780
Gender dysphoria,
the severe discomfort

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:16.860
in one's biological
sex, is absolutely real.

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.320
It's also exceedingly
rare, typically

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:23.670
afflicting roughly
0.01% of the population,

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.320
and overwhelmingly males.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.930
So roughly 1 in
10,000 males meaning,

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.460
nobody you went to
high school with.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.480
And it typically began
in early childhood,

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:39.330
ages two to four,
little boys insisting,

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.590
no, mommy, I'm not a boy.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:43.710
I'm a girl-- boys who were
insistent, consistent,

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.480
and persistent in
this feeling that they

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.180
were in the wrong body.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.570
It is by all accounts
excruciating.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.110
I've talked to many transgender
adults, most of them

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:53.430
biological males.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.560
And they describe
the relentless chafe

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:58.200
of a body that feels all wrong.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.390
Now, there are at least
three separate issues

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:02.340
I'm going to talk about today.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.080
There are the
young kids who have

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:07.950
this, this classic presentation
of gender dysphoria,

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.440
some of whom, the
majority of whom

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.690
would have naturally
outgrown it on their own

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.490
and historically did.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:18.705
Others became what we used
to call transsexual adults.

00:05:18.705 --> 00:05:19.680
There's number two.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.230
There is the social
contagion currently spreading

00:05:22.230 --> 00:05:24.540
among adolescent
girls, many of whom

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.270
do not have typical
gender dysphoria at all.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.660
And third, there
are the activists

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.970
and who have already
begun exploiting

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.610
our confusion and our
sympathies in order

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:38.250
to invade women's
protective spaces

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.740
and destroy women's sports.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.060
They are all very different.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.430
OK, so the young kids.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:47.370
Now, traditionally as I said,
these were overwhelmingly

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.750
little boys.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.660
And if left alone, meaning
with no intervention

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.000
either to change their name
and pronouns, what we now

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.770
call social transition, and no
medical intervention, over 70%

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:02.610
of these kids typically outgrew
gender dysphoria on their own.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:05.610
Most would end up as gay
men, and some would not.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:08.100
Some would not
outgrow it and go on

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:12.990
to be called what we use
to call transsexuals.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:16.380
And these were not--

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:18.570
transsexuals were
not people who used

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:21.810
to pretend they were
somehow really women

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:25.140
or were always truly female.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:27.570
They were just people who felt
most comfortable presenting

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:28.530
as female.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.383
I've talked to a lot
of transgender adults,

00:06:30.383 --> 00:06:32.550
and they'll tell you, they
know that people can tell

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.110
their biology is different.

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.870
But their goal isn't so
much to fool other people

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:41.070
as it is to achieve a level
of comfort with themselves.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.610
For many, that involves hormonal
intervention and surgeries.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.790
And I've talked to several who
say that hormones they took

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:51.000
or the surgeries they
underwent brought them

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.920
a measure of peace.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.810
I can also tell you
that they are generally

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.490
holding down steady jobs and are
leading good, productive lives.

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:02.670
But today, we don't just
leave kids alone who say this

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.430
and let the chips fall where
they may, letting some kids

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.190
outgrow their gender dysphoria
and others to transition

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.840
when they reach adulthood.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.270
Today we decide the
moment a child seems

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.600
not perfectly feminine or
not perfectly masculine,

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.370
today we say, I
know what this is.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.610
This is a trans kid.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:23.820
We take them to a therapist
or doctor, nearly all

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.570
of whom practice so-called
affirmative care, that

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:32.040
is nearly all of whom have
accepted that it is their job

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:36.180
to immediately affirm or
agree with the patient's

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.820
self-diagnosis
and to immediately

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:41.840
help them medically transition.

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:44.180
Teachers affirm young
children in school,

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:47.570
both by teaching the class
that only they, the children,

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.810
know their true genders,
and encouraging kids

00:07:50.810 --> 00:07:53.900
to reintroduce themselves to
the class with their new name

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:56.030
and pronouns.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:59.690
Therapists affirm and encourage
minors down this path,

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.940
and even pediatricians do.

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:04.010
And the typical next
step for these kids,

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.200
after changing their
name and pronouns

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:10.370
to their friends and
classmates, is puberty blockers.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.290
Puberty blockers
shut down the part

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:15.140
of the pituitary that directs
the release of hormones

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.270
catalyzing puberty.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:19.040
The most common
of these drugs is

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.320
called Lupron, a drug
that was originally

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.950
used in the chemical
castration of sex offenders.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:28.190
To this day, it has
never been FDA approved

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.460
to halt healthy puberty.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:36.260
Now you might ask, why would
any parent or doctor do this?

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:39.770
Why would anyone stop the
puberty in a child, even

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:43.280
a child with genuine gender
dysphoria when that child would

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:48.260
be highly likely to outgrow the
gender dysphoria if left alone?

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.510
Some say because
it's traumatizing

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:53.720
to let a child go through the
puberty of the sex to which

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.490
they don't wish to belong.

00:08:56.490 --> 00:08:58.860
The problem of this, of
course, is that in many cases,

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:02.070
puberty does seem to have helped
children overcome their gender

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:03.270
dysphoria.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.910
But there really is no
satisfying answer to why

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.970
someone would do this given
that scientists have no way

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:12.195
of predicting which children
will outgrow the dysphoria

00:09:12.195 --> 00:09:14.970
on their own and which won't.

00:09:14.970 --> 00:09:19.020
But the argument that's made
is that these kids can't wait.

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.780
The suicide rates for
the trans identified

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:26.070
youth and trans adults are
very high, the argument goes.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:29.520
And so we need to get in there
and start fixing them as soon

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:32.260
and dramatically as possible.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.580
But unfortunately, there
are no long-term studies

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:39.180
that indicate that puberty
blockers cure suicidality

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:43.500
or even that they produce
better mental health outcomes.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.180
There are not even
good studies that

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:48.660
show they are safe for
this population long term,

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:51.030
nor that they are reversible.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.460
There's a big debate right
now in the medical community

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.460
about whether and to what
extent the effects of stopping

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:59.280
healthy puberty in
adolescents is reversible

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.130
if these kids later
stop taking them.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.650
What we do know is
that puberty blockers

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:08.040
will block all the secondary
sex characteristics,

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.310
sexual maturation, and
development of bone density

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.630
from occurring.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:16.110
We do know that because of
the inhibition of bone density

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:18.300
and other risks,
doctors don't like

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.220
to keep a child on
puberty blockers for more

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.660
than two years.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:25.110
And we know that once a child's
healthy puberty is arrested,

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:28.440
placing her entirely out
of step with her peers,

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.450
this seems to
guarantee that she will

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.620
proceed to cross-sex
hormones like testosterone.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:39.990
In studies, nearly 100% of kids
who are put on puberty blockers

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.500
proceed to cross-sex hormones.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.560
And we know that if a child
goes from puberty blockers

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:51.210
to cross-sex hormones, that
child will be infertile.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:54.090
She may also have permanent
sexual dysfunction given

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.240
that her sex organs never
reached adult maturity,

00:10:57.240 --> 00:11:00.570
but she will certainly
be infertile.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:02.190
So the claim that
puberty blockers

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:07.320
are safe and reversible for this
population is not well founded.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.780
And the claim that it's a
neutral intervention, just

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.050
a pause button, they say,
without serious downsides

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:15.300
is simply false.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:19.410
We wouldn't accept this
level of glib salesmanship

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:21.785
in any other area of medicine.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:29.170
OK, so those are the kids who
actually have gender dysphoria.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:34.420
For the nearly 100-year history
of diagnosing gender dysphoria,

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.600
these little kids were what
we were talking about when we

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.340
talked about gender dysphoria.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.090
But in the last decade
that, thanks in large part

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.630
to social media, there's been
another population that claims

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.610
to have gender dysphoria.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.770
This is a population
that never before

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.050
had gender dysphoria in
any significant numbers.

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:59.080
In fact, before 2007, there was
no extant scientific literature

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:01.990
on their having gender
dysphoria at all--

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.690
teenage girls.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.180
This is the phenomenon Brown
University Public Health

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:10.510
researcher Dr. Lisa Littman
called "rapid onset gender

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:11.230
dysphoria."

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:19.570
And it refers to a sudden spike
in transgender identification

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:22.420
among teen girls with
no childhood history

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.770
of gender dysphoria at all.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.370
Not only have the rates of
these girls claiming trans

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.220
identification risen
dramatically in the US

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.410
and all across the West--

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:38.500
over 4,400% rise in teen girls
presenting for gender treatment

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:41.980
at the UK's national gender
clinic, for instance--

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:45.280
but teenage girls are now
the leading demographic

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.740
of those claiming to
have gender dysphoria.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.370
What's going on?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:57.470
The answer is social
contagion, one more instance

00:12:57.470 --> 00:13:01.880
of teen girls sharing
and spreading their pain.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.010
There's a long history
of peer contagion

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.150
with this demographic,
of course.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:10.410
We know that anorexia and
bulimia spread this way.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:13.100
And we know that this
demographic, teen girls,

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:18.350
is in the midst of the worst
mental health crisis on record

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:20.660
with the highest
rates of anxiety,

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:25.610
self-harm, and clinical
depression we've ever seen.

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:28.090
We know that the
population who tends

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.670
to fall into social
contagions is

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:34.150
the same high-anxiety,
depressive group of girls

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:37.030
who struggle socially
in adolescence

00:13:37.030 --> 00:13:39.910
and tend to hate their bodies.

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.040
Add to that a school
environment where

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:46.240
you can achieve immediate
valorisation and popularity

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:49.570
by declaring a trans
identity and, of course,

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:54.010
the delicious temptation
to stick it to mom.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:57.970
Add further the great many
trans social media influencers

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:01.660
who can't wait to convince
troubled teen girls

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:04.150
that identifying as
trans and starting

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:09.010
a course of testosterone will
cure all of their problems,

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:13.090
and you have a very fast
spreading social phenomenon.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:15.700
I've spoken to families
at top girls' schools

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:19.060
that will attest
that 15%, or 20%,

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.720
or in one case 30% of the
girls in their daughter's

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:27.940
seventh grade class
now identify as trans.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.860
When you see that,
you're witnessing

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.780
a social contagion in action.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:36.040
There is no other
reasonable explanation.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:41.350
These teen girls are in a
great deal of very real pain.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.630
Almost all of them have
dealt at some point

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.570
with an eating disorder,
or engaged in cutting,

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.930
or have been diagnosed with
other serious mental health

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.000
comorbidities.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.670
And now they're being allowed
to self-diagnose with gender

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:57.220
dysphoria by a
medical establishment

00:14:57.220 --> 00:15:00.850
that's decided its job is
merely to affirm and agree

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:04.150
with these girls, a
medical establishment that

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:08.080
has, with regard to trans
identified adolescents,

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:13.130
effectively turned its
doctors into life coaches.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.170
Since my book,
Irreversible Damage,

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.500
was published in June
of 2020, more evidence

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.060
than I ever could
have imagined has

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:24.050
