this thesis is correct.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:26.540
You may not know
the name Keira Bell.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.350
This is a young woman in the UK,
very troubled in adolescence,

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.870
who was rushed to
transition in her teen years

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.580
and came to regret it.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.340
She underwent double
mastectomy and spent years

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:41.510
on testosterone only to realize
that her problem had never

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:43.130
been gender.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:46.070
She sued the national
gender clinic in England.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.590
And back in December,
the High Court of Justice

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:52.610
examined her case and the
claim of similarly-situated

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:55.700
plaintiffs, and she won.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.090
The Court examined the medical
protocols applied to her,

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:02.870
protocols identical to the
ones we have in America.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:07.470
And the High Court of
Justice was horrified.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:11.880
It was absolutely appalled that
a young girl had been allowed

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.330
to consent to eliminating
her future fertility

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.600
and sexual function at
an age when she could not

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.790
have possibly gauged that loss.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.960
She had begun
transitioning at 15.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.690
This case was called a
landmark case in England.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:32.560
It was covered by The Times of
London, The Economist, and even

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:34.330
The Guardian.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.140
It was seen as a real
condemnation of the effort

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:42.350
to fast track so many
young girls to transition.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.110
And one of the things
the Court noted

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:47.530
was that the clinic
had been unable to show

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.520
any psychological improvement
in the girls it had treated

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.350
with transitioning hormones.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.470
If you didn't read about
the landmark Keira Bell

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:59.385
case in the American
legacy media,

00:16:59.385 --> 00:17:00.760
well, that's
because they decided

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:05.240
to pretend it didn't happen,
just as they continue

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:08.810
to ignore or dismiss the
stories of the thousands

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.670
of detransitioners.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:13.970
These are young women who
underwent medical transition

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.339
and later regretted it and
attempt to reverse course.

00:17:17.339 --> 00:17:19.339
A lot of these
treatments are permanent,

00:17:19.339 --> 00:17:25.849
but they do what they can to try
to reverse some of the effects.

00:17:25.849 --> 00:17:28.369
So in America, the
teen trans phenomenon

00:17:28.369 --> 00:17:31.400
gets treated as a
conservative issue,

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:35.450
that is a political issue
rather than a medical one.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:39.800
And so perhaps the greatest
medical scandal of this decade

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:44.880
is dismissed as a
conservative preoccupation.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:47.130
Finally, there's a
third group of people

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:50.820
we talk about when we talk about
the transgender phenomenon.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.610
And this is the group that
seems to want to eradicate

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:57.450
girls' and women's sports
and protective spaces.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:02.260
Many or most of these proponents
are not transgender themselves,

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:06.420
but they are activists
and they are energized.

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:08.700
And they do seem to be winning.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.400
They promote dangerous
bills like the Equality Act,

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.940
now before the US Senate, which
would make it impossible ever

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:20.010
to distinguish between
biological men and women,

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:24.000
ever to exclude a biological
male from a girls' sports team,

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.120
or a scholarship, or a woman's
protective space like locker

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.010
rooms and prisons.

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:31.140
And they would do
this based entirely

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:34.410
on a male's self-identification.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:37.350
All that a violent
male felon needs to do

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.920
