00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.860
We have these laws
now in California

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.540
and the state of Washington.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:54.600
And as you might
imagine, hundreds

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.420
of biological male
prisoners have already

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.740
applied to transfer in.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.230
For this third group,
it is not enough

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:07.770
that we create a separate
unisex bathroom while preserving

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.600
