who do not wish

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:16.860
to be stigmatized while
preserving the girls'

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.500
team for biological girls.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.930
And it is not enough to
keep a separate safe zone

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:25.470
in a prison for those trans
identified biological men who

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:27.930
