00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.940
They want all men to be
able to self-identify

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:40.720
their way into them, and
they want to do it right now.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.782
So these three groups
are very different.

00:19:42.782 --> 00:19:44.490
You have the young
children, some of whom

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.830
do suffer with gender dysphoria.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.140
You have the adolescent
girls, most of whom

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:51.150
