social contagion.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.670
And you have the activists
who are using the other two

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:57.510
groups to attack women and to
advance their goal of chaos

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:00.510
and social upheaval.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.760
What these three
have in common has

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:05.520
nothing to do with
real gender dysphoria.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:08.070
What they have in common
is that they are all

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:11.190
shrouded in gender ideology.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:13.740
Put another way, what
they have in common

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:16.245
is that they are
all soaked in lies.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:22.260
Lies are told about the risks
of the treatments we administer

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:25.950
to young children, both to
