from suicide.

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:01.370
The way to think
about gender ideology

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:05.030
is that it is a sibling
of critical race theory.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.010
Critical race theory
goes into schools

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:10.400
to convince white kids that
they bear the original sin

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.340
of their skin color.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:16.120
Gender ideology marches
into those same schools

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.520
and tells kindergartners--

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.860
yes, they do this throughout
