00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:41.570
Critical race theory
postulates that race

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:44.840
is the most important
feature of any person

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:47.210
and that white people,
existing as they

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:50.060
do in a state of
racial privilege,

00:21:50.060 --> 00:21:53.870
are not able to participate in
a wide variety of discussions

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:56.180
about our democracy.

00:21:56.180 --> 00:22:00.200
Gender ideology tells women,
which it calls cis women,

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:03.590
that they are not entitled
to their fear or their sense

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:08.660
of unfairness as biological men
invade their protective spaces

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:13.370
and claim their trophies, and
