00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:17.510
In fact, women and girls can't
even use the English language

00:22:17.510 --> 00:22:19.820
to describe their
problem since calling

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:24.620
a trans woman biological male is
an act of transphobic bigotry.

00:22:27.890 --> 00:22:31.040
Both of these invidious,
mendacious dogmas

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:35.540
have corrupted our schools,
our universities, almost all

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:38.330
of our legacy newspapers
and magazines,

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:41.540
