member of the online forum

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:22.160
had been expelled for
mentioning my book.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:26.840
I contacted the
member, the person

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:30.350
who mentioned my book, who
had been expelled, Sean Scott.

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:33.620
And he told me he hadn't
even read my book.

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:36.110
It just sounded
interesting to him.

00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:43.100
He was immediately
banned from the forum

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.600
