00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:49.810
I've heard the same thing
from endocrinologists,

00:23:49.810 --> 00:23:52.270
and psychiatrists,
and pediatricians,

00:23:52.270 --> 00:23:55.660
and scientific researchers
