00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:08.020
all these interventions.

00:24:08.020 --> 00:24:10.930
Those letters aren't published.

00:24:10.930 --> 00:24:14.380
The funding goes to research
that promotes gender transition

00:24:14.380 --> 00:24:17.360
