would offer preferential care

00:24:46.090 --> 00:24:49.370
to patients based on race.

00:24:49.370 --> 00:24:50.840
And on questions
of gender, we're

00:24:50.840 --> 00:24:53.450
seeing it with a mass
celebration of transitioning

00:24:53.450 --> 00:24:56.180
treatments provided
to young people

00:24:56.180 --> 00:24:59.510
