are fully reversible.

00:25:13.610 --> 00:25:14.870
That was the quote.

00:25:14.870 --> 00:25:18.840
Puberty blockers are
fully reversible,

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:23.730
except that that's not something
anyone can claim to know yet.

00:25:23.730 --> 00:25:26.580
They're certainly not
psychologically reversible,

00:25:26.580 --> 00:25:29.070
and they may not be
physically reversible either.

00:25:29.070 --> 00:25:31.980
We simply don't
have the data yet.

00:25:31.980 --> 00:25:34.950
So you're seeing this
startlingly quick corruption

00:25:34.950 --> 00:25:37.230
of medicine and science.

00:25:37.230 --> 00:25:39.330
And it's a symptom
of a larger woke

00:25:39.330 --> 00:25:43.250
corruption of American society.

00:25:43.250 --> 00:25:45.750
Now, there's something I say
every time I am asked to speak.

00:25:45.750 --> 00:25:49.080
And I say this for the simple
reason that it is true.

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:52.140
Transgender adults are some
of the nicest, soberest,

00:25:52.140 --> 00:25:56.400
and kindest people I have met
in my work as a journalist.

00:25:56.400 --> 00:25:59.520
They have good jobs, they
have stable associations,

00:25:59.520 --> 00:26:03.060
and they are leading admirable
and productive lives.

00:26:03.060 --> 00:26:05.610
They have absolutely
no desire to harm women

00:26:05.610 --> 00:26:08.970
or to push transition
en masse on children.

00:26:08.970 --> 00:26:12.790
The activists do
not represent them.

00:26:12.790 --> 00:26:15.060
I have met adult
transgender people

00:26:15.060 --> 00:26:18.090
who seem to have been
helped by transition.

00:26:18.090 --> 00:26:21.660
But also, a belief
in freedom absolutely

00:26:21.660 --> 00:26:26.250
requires allowing adults to make
really consequential decisions

00:26:26.250 --> 00:26:31.650
about their lives, whether it's
adulthood in a free society

00:26:31.650 --> 00:26:34.200
means that you can
change your religion,

00:26:34.200 --> 00:26:37.810
you can change your name,
you can take a dangerous job,

00:26:37.810 --> 00:26:41.940
such as Andy Ngo and I have.

00:26:41.940 --> 00:26:45.480
And, yes, you can choose
to undergo sex reassignment

00:26:45.480 --> 00:26:47.050
surgery.

00:26:47.050 --> 00:26:49.920
And whenever I am asked
and I am in conversation

00:26:49.920 --> 00:26:54.030
with a transgender adult, I
always use their chosen name

00:26:54.030 --> 00:26:55.170
and pronouns.

00:26:55.170 --> 00:26:58.290
And I believe it speaks
well of conservatives

00:26:58.290 --> 00:27:00.360
who extend this courtesy.

00:27:00.360 --> 00:27:03.900
But-- and this is a big but--

00:27:03.900 --> 00:27:07.330
I never lie.

00:27:07.330 --> 00:27:13.120
So I never say and will never
say trans women are women.

00:27:13.120 --> 00:27:15.610
This is a dangerous lie.

00:27:15.610 --> 00:27:18.910
It's a lie which, when
promoted in public,

00:27:18.910 --> 00:27:21.430
leads to unjust
and even dangerous

00:27:21.430 --> 00:27:24.460
consequences for
women and girls.

00:27:24.460 --> 00:27:29.080
When we lie in public, we usher
in all kinds of consequences,

00:27:29.080 --> 00:27:31.750
the obliteration of
women's protective spaces

00:27:31.750 --> 00:27:35.530
and the destruction of
women's and girls' athletics.

00:27:35.530 --> 00:27:39.130
Rejecting lies--
sorry, parroting

00:27:39.130 --> 00:27:44.740
these lies is not mere courtesy,
whatever proponents say.

00:27:44.740 --> 00:27:48.940
It's the cowardly surrender
of women's welfare

00:27:48.940 --> 00:27:54.320
as a sacrifice to the
woke gods, and it's wrong.

00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:58.130
In the public sphere,
the lie is the harm.

00:27:58.130 --> 00:28:01.070
It does damage to our
ability to communicate,

00:28:01.070 --> 00:28:02.780
to comprehend each other.

00:28:02.780 --> 00:28:05.750
And it makes it
impossible to object

00:28:05.750 --> 00:28:09.110
in the face of
unfairness and cruelty.

00:28:09.110 --> 00:28:13.250
If, quote, "a trans girl
really is just a kind of girl

00:28:13.250 --> 00:28:16.880
after all," there is
no basis for objecting

00:28:16.880 --> 00:28:20.820
to a 17-year-old boy who handily
beat all the girls on the track

00:28:20.820 --> 00:28:21.320
team.

00:28:24.510 --> 00:28:31.120
Now, I'm often asked, why are
the trans activists doing this?

00:28:31.120 --> 00:28:34.210
Why would a teacher tell
her class of kindergartners

00:28:34.210 --> 00:28:37.540
that only they know
their true gender?

00:28:37.540 --> 00:28:39.880
What could possibly
be the justification

00:28:39.880 --> 00:28:43.180
for telling small boys that
they might really be girls

00:28:43.180 --> 00:28:47.950
and telling small girls that
they might really be boys?

00:28:47.950 --> 00:28:51.160
The biggest hint I
got to the answer

00:28:51.160 --> 00:28:53.600
came from talking
to detransitioners.

00:28:53.600 --> 00:28:56.080
Remember, these are young
women who underwent transition

00:28:56.080 --> 00:28:59.410
and then later regretted it.

00:28:59.410 --> 00:29:01.360
Again and again, they
told me that while they

00:29:01.360 --> 00:29:06.610
were transitioning, they
were angry, they were sullen,

00:29:06.610 --> 00:29:10.510
and they were
politically radical.

00:29:10.510 --> 00:29:13.360
They very often cut
off their families.

00:29:13.360 --> 00:29:17.290
They were coached in this by
transgender influencers online.

00:29:17.290 --> 00:29:20.890
And they rushed toward
their new glitter families.

00:29:20.890 --> 00:29:23.050
You'll often see
gender confused people

00:29:23.050 --> 00:29:28.120
among the ranks of Antifa or
at Black Lives Matter rallies.

00:29:28.120 --> 00:29:30.810
Having turned against
their families of origin,

00:29:30.810 --> 00:29:36.010
they are easy prey for those
who recruit revolutionaries.

00:29:36.010 --> 00:29:41.810
Put another way, the
chaos is the point.

00:29:41.810 --> 00:29:44.120
Just as the point of
critical race theory

00:29:44.120 --> 00:29:47.670
is to turn the American
people against one another,

00:29:47.670 --> 00:29:50.030
so the point of
gender ideology is

00:29:50.030 --> 00:29:53.240
to stop the formation
of stable families,

00:29:53.240 --> 00:29:56.510
the building blocks
of American life.

00:29:56.510 --> 00:29:57.890
Let me say this again.

00:29:57.890 --> 00:30:01.320
This is not the goal of
all transgender adults,

00:30:01.320 --> 00:30:04.310
but it is the goal
of gender ideology

00:30:04.310 --> 00:30:07.130
and the transgender
movement, namely

00:30:07.130 --> 00:30:09.800
the creation of a
new victim class

00:30:09.800 --> 00:30:14.320
eager to join the revolution.

00:30:14.320 --> 00:30:16.490
So what do we do about this?

00:30:16.490 --> 00:30:21.190
How do we push back on the
onslaught of gender ideology?

00:30:21.190 --> 00:30:24.190
First, we must oppose
the indoctrination

00:30:24.190 --> 00:30:27.490
of children in gender ideology.

00:30:27.490 --> 00:30:30.200
There is absolutely
no good reason for it.

00:30:30.200 --> 00:30:32.560
And it does very real harm.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:36.250
You can absolutely insist
that all children treat

00:30:36.250 --> 00:30:39.190
