00:55:50.540 --> 00:55:55.490
sorry, guys-- what do you
advocate for someone who really

00:55:55.490 --> 00:55:56.750
does need this treatment?

00:55:56.750 --> 00:55:59.630
If we're saying, delay,
delay, let them grow up,

00:55:59.630 --> 00:56:02.060
let them fully develop,
what is the age

00:56:02.060 --> 00:56:03.348
to have this conversation?

00:56:03.348 --> 00:56:04.890
ABIGAIL SHRIER: It's
a good question.

00:56:04.890 --> 00:56:07.610
I would say two things, one to
the point about your church.

00:56:07.610 --> 00:56:09.770
I mean, the part
of the problem is

00:56:09.770 --> 00:56:13.190
we have churches
diagnosing kids, right?

00:56:13.190 --> 00:56:15.890
We have pastors saying,
oh, it's a trans kid.

00:56:15.890 --> 00:56:18.410
They don't know, right?

00:56:18.410 --> 00:56:20.570
There are little boys
who are effeminate

00:56:20.570 --> 00:56:22.940
and girls who are a
little more masculine.

00:56:22.940 --> 00:56:27.070
And they would just grow
up and lead healthy lives.

00:56:27.070 --> 00:56:28.320
Many of them would become gay.

00:56:28.320 --> 00:56:29.510
Some of them wouldn't.

00:56:29.510 --> 00:56:33.020
But today, they turn around
and say, oh, it's a trans kid.

00:56:33.020 --> 00:56:35.780
They've already decided
what the diagnosis

00:56:35.780 --> 00:56:38.960
is, what the identity is,
and started them down a path.

00:56:41.800 --> 00:56:46.058
And it's very unusual
for a medical condition.

00:56:46.058 --> 00:56:47.600
But there's something
else you asked.

00:56:47.600 --> 00:56:49.880
The second question
was, oh, what age?

00:56:49.880 --> 00:56:52.730
Well, here's what I would say.

00:56:52.730 --> 00:56:55.670
I know a lot of
transgender adults.

00:56:55.670 --> 00:56:59.030
And the ones I've talked
to are a leading good lives

00:56:59.030 --> 00:57:02.150
and stable and good
people, and people

00:57:02.150 --> 00:57:04.610
you would absolutely want as
your friends and neighbors.

00:57:04.610 --> 00:57:07.970
They have told me
transitioning is really hard.

00:57:07.970 --> 00:57:10.160
And they were really
grateful for the time

00:57:10.160 --> 00:57:12.860
they spent in therapy
making sure this

00:57:12.860 --> 00:57:14.840
would be right for them.

00:57:14.840 --> 00:57:17.720
They had to spend a
certain period of time

00:57:17.720 --> 00:57:20.090
living as the opposite
gender, trying

00:57:20.090 --> 00:57:24.770
to see if they could do this
because it's very stressful.

00:57:24.770 --> 00:57:27.390
Today, there's no requirement.

00:57:27.390 --> 00:57:30.260
There's no requirement that
you get a therapist note.

00:57:30.260 --> 00:57:32.670
There's no requirement
for anything--

00:57:32.670 --> 00:57:34.670
I mean, almost anything right?

00:57:34.670 --> 00:57:37.250
So depending, I mean, the
age of medical to consent

00:57:37.250 --> 00:57:39.350
varies by state.

00:57:39.350 --> 00:57:44.460
So whatever people ultimately
decide the age may be--

00:57:44.460 --> 00:57:45.780
and I'm not a doctor.

00:57:45.780 --> 00:57:48.770
But whatever people decide
the appropriate age may be,

00:57:48.770 --> 00:57:52.910
it certainly has to come with
some sober medical oversight.

00:57:52.910 --> 00:57:55.130
And right now we
have virtually none.

00:57:55.130 --> 00:57:58.370
What they have is medical
encouragement and celebration.

00:58:01.751 --> 00:58:04.130
SPEAKER 3: Join me in
thanking Mrs. Shrier.

00:58:04.130 --> 00:58:07.480
[APPLAUSE]

